erms of  investing in resilience and then I think  most importantly we need a to take out a  national insurance policy we need the  federal government to take action right  now businesses and you know city  governments are way ahead of the  national governments and so I think  businesses need to do a better job of  lobbying in pressing the national  government to put the kinds of policy in  place that will let us avoid the the  most adverse outcomes
 

